speechtext:
1.	Has the government awarded contracts for clothing and equipment for the troops, to Pollack and Dorfman, since February the 12th, 1941, to date?
2.	If so, (a) how many of such contracts;
(b)	on what date and for what amount in each case; (c) what is the total amount of such contracts, (d) is the cost of the cloth included in the contracts and if not, who supplied the cloth and for what amount?
